  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "品牌與時尚學實習",
    "sub_ename": "BRAND AND FASHION RPRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是實踐『做學問』的課。針對流行時尚趨勢與理論提供學生最貼近的經驗分享與分析，以小組展演或個別輔導（尤其外籍生）的形式來實作互動。學生藉由學到的時尚品牌理論與架構，付諸於實際行動與創作，學習團隊的：組織管理，目標管理，專案管理，與創意管理，培育學生國際觀，時尚眼力，流行直覺與品牌二百細節的專業。課程最後作組內評量。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is a practice of brand and fashion theories. It provides the most effective analysis and experience sharing of popular trends. With the latest trends in fashion and brand marketing strategies, students are encouraged to focus on international fashion and brand management strategies. Internal members assessment will be ficilitated at the end of class.",
